  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "We apply the options to the given equation by using the BODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b2f64c9f79d77b59f47195df405b394d1389881df31e18c68888ff4c37e1e42e.png] \n\nOption 1) 8, 5 and -, +\n\n8 - 44 + __**5 × 25**__ = 203\n\n__**8**__ - 44 __**+ 125**__ = 203\n\n__**133 - 44**__ = 203\n\n89 ≠ 203\n\nOption 2) 8, 44 and -, +\n\n5 - 8 + __**44 × 25**__ = 203\n\n__**5**__ - 8 __**+ **__**__1100__** = 203\n\n__**1105 - 8**__ = 203\n\n1097 ≠ 203\n\nOption 3) 8, 5 and -, ×\n\n8 + __**44 × 5**__ - 25 = 203\n\n__**8 + **__**__220__** - 25 = 203\n\n__**228 **____**- 25**__ = 203\n\n**203 = 203**\n\nOption 4) 8, 44 and -, ×\n\n5 + __**8 × 44**__ - 25 = 203\n\n__**5 + **__**__352__** - 25 = 203\n\n__**357 -**____** 25**__ = 203\n\n332 ≠ 203\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 3\".",
